# PandaWorks Studios — Calibration Profile License

Copyright © 2026 PandaWorks Studios. All rights reserved except as expressly permitted below.

## Purpose

The ELEGOO Centauri Carbon Series repository provides free access to independently tested filament calibration profiles and related resources.

These resources are published for the benefit of the 3D-printing community. They are intended to remain freely available through the official PandaWorks Studios repository.

## Permitted Use

Users are welcome to:

- Download and use the calibration profiles free of charge.
- Modify settings for their own printers, filaments, and printing environments.
- Use the profiles for personal, professional, educational, or commercial 3D printing.
- Sell physical objects manufactured using these profiles without restrictions or royalties imposed by this license.
- Discuss the calibration settings and share links to the official repository.

## Distribution Restrictions

Except where otherwise permitted by applicable law or GitHub's Terms of Service, the following activities are not authorized without prior written permission:

- Selling the repository's calibration files, profiles, or packaged downloads.
- Charging for access to the calibration data.
- Mirroring, rehosting, or republishing the repository's files on other websites or repositories.
- Redistributing the original files as part of another collection, application, or downloadable package.
- Redistributing modified versions of the repository's files.
- Presenting the published calibration profiles as one's own original calibration work.

Please direct anyone interested in obtaining these profiles to the official repository.

## Official Distribution

https://github.com/Ganja-Panda/Elegoo-Centauri-Carbon-Series

The official repository is the intended distribution source for current profiles, updates, documentation, and release archives.

## Ownership and Scope

This notice does not claim exclusive ownership of individual numerical calibration values, independently discovered settings, or other material that is not protected by applicable intellectual property law.

The restrictions concern the authorized distribution and republication of protected repository materials.

## Disclaimer

All calibration profiles are provided as-is, without warranty, to the extent permitted by law.

Individual results may vary based on printer hardware, firmware, filament, environmental conditions, and other factors.

Users are responsible for reviewing and testing settings before applying them to their equipment.

